# Plan 768 pilot suite

Read-only import pilot: every source/oracle stays in its legacy location
(`fixture_root: "../.."` = `crates/auto-lang/test/`); new reviewed emit
oracles live under `cases/pilot/oracle/`. See legacy-map.tsv for the
case-by-case reconciliation against the old runners.

```test-suite
suite {
  schema: "autolang.suite/1"
  id: "pilot"
  fixture_root: "../.."
  include: [
    "vm-basics.case.ad",
    "vm-shortcircuit.case.ad",
    "vm-script.case.ad",
    "a2r-basics.case.ad",
    "a2r-cabi.case.ad",
    "a2r-project.case.ad"
  ]
  defaults: { tier: "vm-corpus" }
}
```
